## 5. Chunk Size Estimates and Token Economics

| Document Type | Chunks Per File | Words Per Chunk | Tokens Per Chunk |
|---|---|---|---|
| DDR HTML | 8–12 sections | 100–400 words | 130–500 tokens |
| Well Summary PDF | 2–3 pages | 200–350 words | 260–450 tokens |
| Survey header (all types) | 1 | 60–100 words | 80–130 tokens |

**Total estimated chunks in the whole archive:**
- 32 DDR HTML × 10 sections avg = **~320 chunks**
- 21 Well Summary PDFs × 2.5 pages avg = **~52 chunks**
- 5 Relief Well Summary PDFs × 2 pages avg = **~10 chunks**
- 109 raw text survey headers × 1 = **~109 chunks**
- Total: **~491 chunks** across the entire archive

**Token cost at query time:**  
We retrieve top 3 chunks per question → 3 × ~400 tokens = ~1,200 tokens context  
Add question (~50 tokens) + answer (~200 tokens) = **~1,450 tokens per question**  
32 questions × 1,450 = **~46,400 tokens total for all 32 questions**

At Gemini Flash pricing: approximately **\$0.03–0.05** for the entire 32-question run.

