## 10. Output Format

Every row in `predictions.csv` follows this format:

```
question_id, answer, evidence, confidence
T2-003, "The deepest survey station on 15/9-F-11 B on 2013-05-29 showed an inclination of 42.17° at a depth of 3,850 mMD.", "15_9_F_11_B_2013_05_29.html; Section: Survey Station", 0.95
T2-027, "No daily drilling report for well 15/9-F-14 on 2013-06-10 exists in the supplied archive.", "document_manifest.csv — well 15/9-F-14 not present", 1.0
```

Evidence always includes:
1. The **exact filename**
2. The **section name** (for DDR HTML) or **page number** (for PDFs) or **"Header"** (for survey files)

