## 12. Summary of Key Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| DDR format | HTML only | Cleanest, structured, one format is enough |
| Survey file indexing | Header only (~38 lines) | Numbers below header have no Q&A value |
| Prototype files | Header indexed, number table discarded | Same structure as PLAN/ACTUAL; header has useful metadata |
| Embedding model | Gemini `text-embedding-004` | We have the API key; high quality |
| Vector store | FAISS (local) | No server needed; fast; judges can run offline |
| Retrieval | Filter by well+date first, then semantic search | Reduces noise; much more precise |
| LLM | Gemini Flash, temperature=0 | Deterministic; affordable; fast |
| Token budget per query | ~1,450 tokens | 3 chunks + question + answer |
| Total token budget (32 Qs) | ~46,400 tokens | Practically free at Flash pricing |
| Abstention handling | Explicit "not in archive" response | Earns full 1.0 mark under rubric |

